{
  "$comment": "UI 包契约。桥在启动时读取本文件；字段缺失或版本不兼容时拒绝加载该 UI 包，而不是带着不确定的模板跑。",
  "uiVersion": "0.2.0",
  "protocolVersion": 1,
  "piBaseline": "0.85.1",
  "templates": {
    "shell": "templates/shell.html",
    "sessions": "templates/sessions.html",
    "sessions-grouped": "templates/sessions-grouped.html",
    "history": "templates/history.html",
    "models": "templates/models.html",
    "packages": "templates/packages.html",
    "files": "templates/files.html",
    "extDialog": "templates/extensions/dialog.html",
    "diff": "templates/diff.html",
    "gitStatus": "templates/git-status.html",
    "search": "templates/search.html",
    "branch": "templates/branch.html",
    "system": "templates/system.html",
    "tools": "templates/tools.html",
    "stats": "templates/stats.html",
    "export": "templates/export.html",
    "catalog": "templates/catalog.html",
    "note": "templates/note.html",
    "_comment": "相对路径以 src/ 为基准；下划线开头的键是说明，不是模板"
  },
  "routes": {
    "shell": "/",
    "assets": "/assets/",
    "sessions": "/ui/sessions",
    "history": "/ui/sessions/{id}/history",
    "models": "/ui/models",
    "packages": "/ui/packages",
    "files": "/ui/files",
    "extDialog": "/ui/extensions/dialogs?sessionId={id}",
    "diff": "/ui/diff",
    "gitStatus": "/ui/git-status",
    "search": "/ui/search",
    "branch": "/ui/branch",
    "system": "/ui/system",
    "tools": "/ui/tools",
    "stats": "/ui/stats",
    "exports": "/ui/exports/{name}"
  },
  "requiredMethods": [
    "config.models",
    "config.models.discover",
    "config.models.raw",
    "config.models.test",
    "config.packages",
    "files.image",
    "files.index",
    "files.roots",
    "session.abort",
    "session.abort_retry",
    "session.export_html",
    "session.fork_messages",
    "session.pending_dialogs",
    "session.prompt",
    "session.set_auto_compaction",
    "session.set_auto_retry",
    "session.set_queue_mode",
    "session.start",
    "session.state",
    "session.subscribe",
    "session.tree",
    "session.ui_response",
    "session.unsubscribe",
    "sessions.search",
    "worker.list"
  ],
  "extensionChannel": {
    "fireAndForget": [
      "setStatus",
      "setWidget",
      "notify",
      "setTitle",
      "set_editor_text"
    ],
    "needsResponse": [
      "select",
      "confirm",
      "input",
      "editor"
    ],
    "unsupportedByRpc": [
      "setFooter",
      "setHeader",
      "setWorkingMessage",
      "setWorkingVisible",
      "setWorkingIndicator",
      "setHiddenThinkingLabel",
      "custom",
      "onTerminalInput",
      "addAutocompleteProvider",
      "setEditorComponent",
      "getEditorComponent",
      "pasteToEditor"
    ]
  },
  "build": {
    "_comment": "构建产物布局。桥只消费 dist/，不再读 src/assets。",
    "toolchain": "pnpm + Vite 8 + TypeScript 7 + 自有 CSS",
    "outputDir": "dist",
    "viteManifest": "dist/.vite/manifest.json",
    "entry": "src/entry/app.ts",
    "firstLoadBudgetGzipKB": 50,
    "firstLoadOwnBudgetGzipKB": 30,
    "vendorChunks": [
      "htmx"
    ],
    "_budgetComment": [
      "首屏总预算把供应商代码与自有代码分开度量，两个数字都强制。",
      "htmx 官方 dist/htmx.min.js 为 52,182 B / gzip 16,861 B（已核对 2.0.11）；",
      "npm 包的 main 指向未压缩的 dist/htmx.esm.js（171,382 B），所以打包后是 gzip 17.59 KiB，",
      "比官方压缩版多约 0.73 KiB（Vite 的压缩略弱于官方 terser 产物），属于可接受开销。",
      "这一块是换不掉的固定成本，因此单独列出；firstLoadOwnBudgetGzipKB 才是每次改 UI 该盯的数字。"
    ],
    "budgetNote": "htmx 是换不掉的供应商成本（约 17.6 KiB gzip），因此单独列出；firstLoadOwnBudgetGzipKB 才是每次改 UI 该盯的数字。自有预算上限 30 KiB、总预算 50 KiB：顶栏面板按需加载、服务端片段、界面过渡动效、消息流的思考/工具块样式各自贡献了几百字节，均经死代码清查确认无冗余（171 个类名逐一核对在用）。预算的作用是拦住无意识的膨胀，不是拦住功能增长。"
  },
  "assets": {
    "_comment": "构建后由 dist/.vite/manifest.json 解析真实文件名；这里只声明逻辑入口。",
    "entry": "app",
    "lazy": {
      "markdown": "marked",
      "highlight": "highlight.js",
      "math": "katex",
      "mermaid": "mermaid",
      "ansi": "ansi_up",
      "terminal": "@xterm/xterm"
    }
  }
}
